## 🔄 Implementation Tasks

> **Execution & Smart 2-Tier Testing Rules:**
> - **Layer Labels:** `[BE]` (Backend/Data/Unit Tests), `[FE]` (Frontend/UI), `[E2E]` (Playwright Golden-Path Browser Test), `[REVIEW]` (Verification Checkpoint)
> - **Model Modes:** Frontier models may execute a `⚡ BATCH` group (max 3–4 coupled files) together via `/build`. Fast/Low-Tier models must execute **1 sub-task (`1.1`, `1.2`) at a time**.
> - **Multi-View / Complex Feature Rule:** If a feature has multiple sub-tabs, views, or modals (e.g. Sub-Tab A: Destinations, Sub-Tab B: Sources & Exclusions), DO NOT lump all UI into one batch. Split them into separate `⚡ BATCH` sections (`### 2. Frontend Sub-View A...`, `### 3. Frontend Sub-View B...`), each ending with a `[REVIEW]` checkpoint task.
> - **Tier 1 — Mandatory Unit Tests (`- [ ]` Task `1.3`):** Every feature MUST have fast headless unit/invariant tests (`src/features/<domain>/__tests__/*.test.ts`, `tests/Unit/*Test.php`, `pytest`, or `forge test`) written and executed during `/build`.
> - **Tier 2 — Smart Playwright E2E Tests (Task `3.1` or `4.1` in `e2e/<feature>.spec.ts`):**
>   - **Mandatory (`- [ ]`)** for **Critical User Journeys** (Auth/Onboarding, Core Product Value Loop, Checkout/Billing).
>   - **Optional (`- [ ]*`)** for secondary/settings UI features (verified via Level 3 AI Live Browser UAT).

### 1. Data Layer, Server Logic & Unit Tests (`⚡ BATCH`: Coupled Schema, Handler & Unit Tests)
- [ ] **1.1** `[BE]` Create schema/types and domain validation in `[exact/file/path]`
  - [Implementation details from `design.md`]
  - _Requirements: 1.1, 1.3_
- [ ] **1.2** `[BE]` Implement server handler/controller in `[exact/file/path]`
  - Enforce auth/RLS/nonce → input validation → persistence
  - _Requirements: 1.2, 1.3, 2.2_
- [ ] **1.3** `[BE]` Write & run automated unit/invariant tests in `[src/features/<domain>/__tests__/<feature>.test.ts or tests/Unit/<Domain>/<Feature>Test.php]`
  - Test happy-path (`Property 1`) and invalid/unauthorized rejection (`Property 2`) using `.agents/skills/build/examples/feature.test.ts.template`
  - _Validates: Property 1, Property 2 (Requirements 1.1, 1.2, 1.3, 2.2)_
- [ ] **1.4** `[REVIEW]` **Backend & Unit Test Checkpoint:** Run `pnpm tsc --noEmit && pnpm test --run` (or `php -l` & `vendor/bin/phpunit`) — must pass with zero errors (triggers auto-checkpoint commit in `/build`)

### 2. Frontend Primary View / Sub-Tab A (`⚡ BATCH`: e.g. Destinations Tab / Main Screen)
- [ ] **2.1** `[FE]` Build primary UI component(s) / view in `[exact/file/path]` matching `design-reference/` and `docs/foundation/design-system.md`
  - _Requirements: 1.1, 1.3_
- [ ] **2.2** `[FE]` Wire user interactions, state persistence, and entrypoint in `[exact/file/path]`
  - _Requirements: 1.1_
- [ ] **2.3** `[REVIEW]` **Sub-View A Checkpoint:** Run lint/build (`pnpm tsc --noEmit && pnpm build` / `npm run build && php -l`) — must pass with zero errors (triggers auto-checkpoint commit in `/build`)

### 3. Frontend Secondary View / Sub-Tab B / Modals (`⚡ BATCH`: e.g. Sources Tab / Complex Modals — if applicable)
